{'symbol': 'KO', 'date': '2021-10-05 07:00:00', 'title': 'TOPO CHICO HARD SELTZER TO RELEASE MARGARITA HARD SELTZER VARIETY PACK IN 2022', 'text': "CHICAGO, OCT. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AFTER A RECORD-BREAKING FIRST YEAR FOR TOPO CHICO HARD SELTZER, MOLSON COORS BEVERAGE COMPANY TODAY ANNOUNCES THE BRAND'S SECOND VARIETY PACK AND FIRST-FULL FLAVOR EXTENSION -- TOPO CHICO MARGARITA HARD SELTZER VARIETY PACK. ARRIVING IN 2022, THE MARGARITA HARD SELTZER VARIETY PACK COMES JUST WEEKS AFTER MOLSON COORS SHARED ITS PLANS TO EXPAND TOPO CHICO HARD SELTZER FROM ITS CURRENT REGIONAL FOOTPRINT TO ALL 50 STATES IN JANUARY 2022."}